    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1675\"><em data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1675\">(3rd Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1712\"><strong data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1690\">Contract:</strong> <em data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1712\">No One Left Behind.</em></p><p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1763\">Once per scene, when an ally would fall, you may:</p><ul data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1874\"><li data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1798\"><p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1798\">Redirect some harm to yourself,</p></li><li data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1828\"><p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1828\">Stabilize them immediately,</p></li><li data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1874\"><p data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1874\">Grant protected withdrawal without pursuit.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1921\">This is not dominance.<br data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1901\" />It is shared burden.</p><h3 data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1931\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2013\">Spend 1 Surge to amplify (increase stabilization or protection value).</p><h3 data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2027\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2093\">Repeated magical rescues may reduce community autonomy over time.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
